    thinking: "**Analyzing Deployment Success**\n\nOkay, the `firestore.rules` are deployed, that\'s a good start! Now I\'m shifting focus to the user-provided assets. I\'m taking a look at the images and checking the HTML snapshots, specifically the URLs. I noticed a vanity logo link, which I\'m evaluating.\n\n\n**Reviewing Asset URLs**\n\nNow, I\'m verifying the URLs for the profile avatar and Rare Beauty assets. The provided URLs look valid, so I\'m cross-checking them for their content and origin. I will further analyze the content served to verify nothing unexpected is loaded.\n\n\n**Validating New Assets**\n\nI\'m now focusing on two new assets: the Soft Pinch Blush product and the Positive Light Highlighter. I\'m carefully examining the provided URLs for these items. They look valid, and I\'m prepared to evaluate their content.\n\n\n**Verifying New Product URLs**\n\nI am now validating the URLs for three new product assets: the Warm Wishes Bronzer Stick, Kind Words Matte Lip Liner, and Discovery Eyeshadow Palette. The provided links point to Googleusercontent content, which I need to analyze for any irregularities. My attention is on the `lh3.googleusercontent.com` origin and the files being served.\n\n\n**Examining Additional URLs**\n\nI\'m now validating three more product asset URLs. The focus is now on the \"Universal Volumizing Mascara,\" \"Dior Backstage Lip Glow Oil,\" and \"Dior Brand Crest.\" I am analyzing these URLs, checking their Googleusercontent origins, and looking for anything unusual in their content or structure. I\'m applying the same scrutiny as before.\n\n\n\n**Scrutinizing Brand Crests**\n\nI\'m now deep-diving into the brand crest URLs. Specifically, I\'m examining the `Charlotte Tilbury`, `Fenty Beauty`, and `NARS` crests. These links are from the Googleusercontent origin. I\'m applying the same content analysis methodology to these URLs as the previous ones, seeking consistency and any potential anomalies.\n\n\n**Analyzing New Assets**\n\nI\'m now examining the Maybelline brand assets: the crest, and the Sky High Mascara. Also, I\'m carefully reviewing the Charlotte Tilbury Flawless Filter. These are all Googleusercontent links, and I\'m looking closely at their origins and content. I\'m taking a close look at the URLs to verify nothing unusual is loaded.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 9
      nanos: 648647627
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
