  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing The Context**\n\nI\'m now building the `VanityContext` component. It\'s designed to handle user authentication states like `user`, `loadingAuth`, login/logout with Google, and syncing `brands` and `products` from Firestore. I\'m ensuring graceful fallbacks to initial data when the user isn\'t authenticated, so that the application functions seamlessly regardless of the authentication state.\n\n\n**Defining Product Operations**\n\nNow I\'m fleshing out the CRUD operations for products and brands within `VanityContext`. I\'m focusing on functions for adding, updating, deleting, and toggling favorite status of products. I\'m also including brand management, like adding, updating, setting active brands. I\'m working on managing the state for active tabs, selected products, and brand filters.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 10
      nanos: 452035809
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
