  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing the Header**\n\nI\'ve been sketching out the `Header.tsx` component. It will feature a vanity logo and title, which will change according to the view, along with a notification bell with a pink dot and a profile avatar that triggers a dropdown. It feels like this is on the right track.\n\n\n**Defining the Bottom Nav**\n\nI\'m now diving into the `BottomNav.tsx` component, envisioning a fixed, safe-area-padded bar. I\'m planning out the icons for \"Tocador,\" \"Marcas,\" a central floating action button (FAB) with a pink glow, \"Deseos,\" and \"Perfil.\" The FAB will add a new product.\n\n\n**Elaborating Product Details**\n\nI\'m now fully immersed in designing the `ProductDetailModal.tsx` and `AddProductView.tsx` screens. The modal will be a full-screen or slide-up view, echoing the design in the prompt images, complete with a back button, vanity icon, product detail, and share features. It includes status selectors, a large hero image, brand linking, and shade details. \"AddProductView\" will be the screen to add the cosmetics. I\'ve thought of adding editable review notes.\n\n\n**Refining Product Input**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the detailed input elements for adding a product. I am working on the image upload card with options for camera, gallery, drag-and-drop, and URL. I\'m focusing on the field for \'Marca,\' incorporating chip selections with an option to add a new brand. I\'m building out the \'Producto & Referencia,\' \'Categor\303\255a,\' and \'Tono/Shade\' fields, plus status, PAO, location, and notes.\n\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 5
      nanos: 328244431
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
